1338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","login":"akien-mga","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga"},"body":"YOLO approval as you're the only one really doing and review changes to 3.x. I agree there's a lot of tech debt in PoolVector and it's worth a try to see if we can solve it without regression - if not, we can always revert, fully or partially.\n\nI smoke tested on Jetpaca, it seems to run just fine. No performance difference noted on the first level.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121463#pullrequestreview-4863590161","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121463","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2026-08-05T10:49:25Z"},{"id":4864440619,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABIfF5Kw","state":"APPROVED","commit_id":"77868dcd9c2cbc56c35ddcd344c79809d348e9ed","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?u=f7f8e0273f784f5ec6f6b7fe4a88d449896eb48a&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","login":"Ivorforce","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce"},"body":"I've only reviewed the minimum, with AI assistance, but for what it's worth I'm fairly confident that this is mergable.\r\n\r\nI don't 100% understand why we wake the sleeping dogs by exchanging an entire core type's guts for 3.x, but I've never seen `PoolVector` and don't know what kinds of problems it had, so I trust lawnjelly's judgement.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121463#pullrequestreview-4864440619","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121463","author_association":"MEMBER","su